// M3 language-boundary negative (): protocol-native payment terms (ISO 20022 / SWIFT
// pacs.*) are handled as a reviewed lower-layer translation-map (docs/domains/LOWER_LAYER.md),
// NOT as `.neu` source keywords. Writing one as a procedure statement must be rejected
// with "unexpected statement". See docs/language/LANGUAGE_BOUNDARY.md §2. Pinned by self-test [56].
procedure interbank_settlement {
    input amount : money

    pacs.008 FIToFICustomerCreditTransfer
}
